
#REST API   


### Get all
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Get by id 
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/dfa1693f-7698-49c1-9c79-26a6d1c661bd

### Create User
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

